OL,5,G0335 Secret Nazi Bases
OL,6,     FThe Secrets of Nazi Future Tech:
OL,7,     FHidden in a remote mountainous
OL,8,     Fforest is a structure nicknamed
OL,9,     Fthe Fly Trap or Hitler's
OL,10,     FStonehenge. Researchers still have
OL,11,     Fno definitive idea what it is.
OL,12,G0420 Secret Nazi Bases
OL,13,     FFuelling Evil: Outside the town of
OL,14,     FPolitz lie the ruins of what was
OL,15,     Fonce one of Germany's most
OL,16,     Fimportant assets - a place that
OL,17,     Fkept the German war machine
OL,18,     Fmoving.
